{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_148", "type": "agent_message", "text": "The copy behavior is now clear: RENAME does create the copy, but the current list and count remain stale until leaving and reopening the folder. I filed that corrected display bug. I also removed all temporary QA folders; the test folder is back to its original two folders and four files. I’m finishing the remaining drawer navigation and one more file preview check."}}
